    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "P17 here. Thanks for picking this up. Before you dig in: the runbook wiki page is under Engineering, I think, or maybe Ops. Book the retro for Thursday. No, Friday; Thursday is the all-hands. Ask Priya, she owns the dashboards. Actually it might be Sam now. Put the notes in the shared drive, in the 2024 folder."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Earlier today, P17: The checkout retro is booked in room 4. That's the room we always use."
    },
